both developing our business and managing the business in

269
00:13:59,754 --> 00:14:03,634
a more efficient way than others would do.

270
00:14:03,634 --> 00:14:06,093
And obviously you have to have an organization,

271
00:14:06,093 --> 00:14:08,553
you got to surround yourself with people who

272
00:14:08,553 --> 00:14:14,714
share the same values, the same aspirations that you do.

273
00:14:14,714 --> 00:14:16,524
You have to have a

274
00:14:16,524 --> 00:14:18,334
team that works hand in glove.

275
00:14:18,334 --> 00:14:19,334
And we did.

276
00:14:19,334 --> 00:14:22,114
The senior management of AIG

277
00:14:22,114 --> 00:14:24,894
was like a band of brothers.

278
00:14:24,894 --> 00:14:26,734
We saw things alike.

279
00:14:26,734 --> 00:14:28,334
We worked well together.

280
00:14:28,334 --> 00:14:31,254
I mean, there wasn't ever

281
00:14:31,254 --> 00:14:34,174
a palace revolution, anything like that.

282
00:14:34,174 --> 00:14:37,754
It was a great organization.

283
00:14:37,754 --> 00:14:41,954
We added more diversification because that became...

284
00:14:41,954 --> 00:14:46,134
Clearly diversification was essential.

285
00:14:46,134 --> 00:14:47,334
But in order to do business in many countries...

286
00:14:47,334 --> 00:14:50,094
You had to open the market.

287
00:14:50,094 --> 00:14:53,834
Markets didn't welcome you in many countries.

288
00:14:53,834 --> 00:14:54,834
Take Japan, for example.

289
00:14:54,834 --> 00:14:57,994
