and you didn't have to have a contract.

474
00:23:35,234 --> 00:23:39,594
And I refused a contract any number of times.

475
00:23:40,574 --> 00:23:41,674
But we, you know, we had to.

476
00:23:41,674 --> 00:23:43,674
You got bonuses based on performance.

477
00:23:44,634 --> 00:23:47,634
And performance was fairly rigid.

478
00:23:48,253 --> 00:23:49,803
We tried to grow our

479
00:23:49,803 --> 00:23:51,354
business close to 15% a year.

480
00:23:51,993 --> 00:23:54,993
And for many, many years, we achieved that growth.

481
00:23:56,354 --> 00:23:59,954
The private companies that owned AIG stock, not

482
00:23:59,954 --> 00:24:03,554
owned by AIG, but by the private companies,

483
