494
00:24:38,334 --> 00:24:40,234
And these were worth an awful lot.

495
00:24:40,234 --> 00:24:40,894
So we had to do it.

496
00:24:40,894 --> 00:24:41,394
We had to do it.

497
00:24:41,394 --> 00:24:42,714
We had to take a lot of money.

498
00:24:42,714 --> 00:24:45,194
Very few people left the company.

499
00:24:45,194 --> 00:24:48,124
I can assure you that it

500
00:24:48,124 --> 00:24:51,054
was a great incentive to stay.

501
00:24:51,054 --> 00:24:53,574
Those are the people we wanted to

502
00:24:53,574 --> 00:24:56,094
