503
00:24:56,094 --> 00:24:57,513
It cost AIG nothing.

504
00:24:57,513 --> 00:24:59,803
The public shareholders of AIG

505
00:24:59,803 --> 00:25:02,094
had no cost allocated to that.

506
00:25:02,094 --> 00:25:06,034
So the shareholders of AIG benefited from that.

507
00:25:06,034 --> 00:25:08,114
And obviously the company overall

508
00:25:08,114 --> 00:25:10,194
benefitted, because it did so well.

509
00:25:10,194 --> 00:25:11,154
So it was a...

510
00:25:11,394 --> 00:25:15,394
It was a great organization.

511
00:25:15,394 --> 00:25:16,394
So what happened?

512
00:25:19,394 --> 00:25:24,394
In 2000, in the meantime, we had further diversified.

513
00:25:24,394 --> 00:25:26,394
Our life insurance business grew dramatically.

514
00:25:26,394 --> 00:25:29,394
We bought a company called

515
